Assignment tittle: Visual Prompt Studio Phase 1.1

Prompt: A digital illustration film poster of an overgrown, abandoned space station drifting in deep space. Sharp geometric structural lines of shattered corridors intersect with chaotic, irregular wires and dramatic directional lines that guide the viewer’s eye toward the center. The composition is dominated by large organic negative space surrounding a massive, solid metallic space ship with high physical volume and rough, pitted alien rock textures. High value contrast featuring a blinding, sharp beam of white light cutting through deep, dark shadows establishes a clear focal point on a solitary astronaut standing at the edge of a broken platform.

Vocabulary breakdown:
Line: A line connects two points
Contrast: It is the use of two noticeably different states of an element
Volume: Volume is the amount of space occupied by an object
Texture: is the tactile sensation when we physically encounter a three-dimensional form
